# Reference solutions — kept locally, intentionally not published.
# Every exercise in this repo is meant to be solved by the learner; shipping
# the answer key in the public repo would defeat that. Folders named
# "solution" or "solutions" anywhere in the tree are excluded.
**/solution/
**/solutions/

# Java build output
*.class
/out/
/target/
/build/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
